==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card is almost identical to {{TCG ID|Burning Shadows|Wimpod|16}} from the {{TCG|Burning Shadows}} expansion, except for the {{TCG|Weakness}} modifier; both cards have the same illustration.
*{{a|Wimp Out}} is an [[Ability]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Wimpod}} can have. 
*'''Gnaw''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Base Set|Pikachu|58}} from the {{TCG|Base Set}}. 
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

